<section id="work-with-me" aria-label="Work with Susan" class="py-16 sm:py-20 border-t" style="border-color: var(--color-border)">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[680px] px-6 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold mb-7">Work with me</h2>

    <div class="space-y-5 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Alongside Kaleida, I take on a small number of fractional CTO and advisory engagements.
        If you're a founder or engineering leader who wants a senior technical partner in the room,
        to shape architecture, grow a team, or steady the build, I'd like to hear from you.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm also always up for turning good work into a good story. If you've got a hard problem
        worth digging into, let's build a case study together: real work on a real challenge, written
        up and shared on stage and in writing, with your blessing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3" role="list">
      <a
        href="mailto:hello@susanbrander.com?subject=Fractional%20%2F%20advisory%20enquiry"
        role="listitem"
        class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md font-medium text-sm no-underline hover:no-underline transition-colors"
      >
        Start a conversation
      </a>
      <a
        href="mailto:hello@susanbrander.com?subject=Building%20a%20case%20study%20together"
        role="listitem"
        class="btn-secondary inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md font-medium text-sm no-underline hover:no-underline border transition-colors"
      >
        Build a case study together
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: white;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border-color: var(--color-border);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
